\begin{remark} A group $G$ satisfies \eqref{2.RecognizingCoordinates} of Theorem~\ref{T.RecognizingCoordinates} if and only if for any non-trivial normal subgroup $H$ of $G$, $C_G(H)=\{e\}$.
