	Let  $\Sh= \prod_\Ideal{I} \mathfrak{M}$ be a reduced product of the magma $\mathfrak{M}$. Then
	$\Sh$ interprets parameter-freely the Boolean algebra $\Bool{I}{I}$  and the relative support function 
	\[\supp_=: \Sh^2\rightarrow \mathcal{P}(\mathbb{N})/I,   (a,a') \mapsto  [\{i\in \Index{I} \mid a_i=a_i'\}]_\Ideal{I} .\] 
