Next, we try to merge $\{b\}$ with $\{a\}$.  The automaton $\pnfa_0 / J(\pi_1, \{b\}, \{a\})$, shown in Figure~\ref{fig:u2_u1}, cannot be determinized   due to non-deterministic transitions with $a$ to both $aa$ and $ba$ which have different colors. 
