We proceed by comparing the valuations of $2^{16}J_8$ and $(c-2\sqrt{bd})$ in each of the 54 cases and show that replacing $\delta$ by $\delta'$ always yields the same case of the classification in \ref{Genus2SubSection} and that $\delta=\delta'$ whenever $\delta$ appears in a formula for the thickness of a double point. These are straightforward computations, which  can be found in \cite{WorksheetsG25}.
